# Rust build output. Anchored to the repo root (leading slash) so it does NOT
# also ignore source directories named `target/` deeper in the tree — e.g.
# apps/ares-sec/src/target/, which was silently dropped from the SEC-1 import by
# the previous unanchored `target/` rule. The Rust engine's own build output is
# ignored by core/.gitignore.
/target/
